  "describe": "The render taps Week on the underline bar: it lights up in blue with the underline under it; Day and Month are muted. Below, the segmented control has Month (view = 2) as a filled blue pill with a white label on a light grey pill track, Day and Week in dark text. The tabs share the width by weight and the underline and pill are fractions of componentWidth(): at 234 and 540 dp the middle tap still selects Week and both bars fit. Mono: Month is a white pill with black text on a black track ringed in grey.",
